                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the most important criterion for skincare Shopify agency?</h3>
                                        <p>Named skincare Shopify sites built (live URLs). If they can't point to real skincare Shopify stores, they don't have skincare-vertical experience. Category-specific requirements will bite you post-launch.</p>
                                        <h3>Regular Shopify or Shopify Plus for skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Regular for Rs 15L-1.5 Cr / month. Plus for Rs 1.5-25 Cr / month. Headless for Rs 5 Cr+ / month + performance-critical. Choose based on current + 24-month projected revenue + SKU count + feature complexity.</p>
                                        <h3>How long does a skincare Shopify build take?</h3>
                                        <p>4-6 weeks Boutique (Rs 2-4L). 6-10 weeks Mid-market (Rs 4-8L). 10-16 weeks Enterprise (Rs 8-15L). 12-18 weeks Headless (Rs 12-25L).</p>
                                        <h3>What apps must a skincare Shopify have?</h3>
                                        <p>Skin quiz (Tolstoy/Octane AI/Rebuy) + subscription (Bold/Recharge/Shopify Subscriptions) + WhatsApp (Interakt/AiSensy) + reviews (Judge.me/Yotpo) + Klaviyo email + shipping insurance (Route). Rs 30-100K/month tooling.</p>
                                        <h3>Do we need multi-currency + multi-language Shopify?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes if targeting GCC + international. INR + AED + SAR + USD + GBP + Hindi + Arabic + English. Adds 2-4 weeks + Rs 1-3L to build.</p>
                                        <h3>What is realistic Shopify post-launch retainer for skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 40K-1.5L / month. Covers feature dev + updates + CRO + A/B + bug fixes + analytics. Growth-tier brands bundle Shopify + marketing retainer.</p>
                                        <h3>How much do we budget for skincare Shopify build + first year?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 4-15L build + Rs 5-18L first-year post-launch retainer. Total Rs 9-33L first-year + Rs 2-8L for photography + video + Rs 8-25K/month tooling apps.</p>
                                        <h3>Does ITD build skincare Shopify + also run marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes end-to-end. Shopify + skincare-specific apps + post-launch retainer + marketing (paid + SEO + content + WhatsApp + influencer). Continuity across build + growth + iteration. See <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a>.</p>
